    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">List - I</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">List - II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(a)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(i)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Current is in phase with emf</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(b)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Current lags behind the applied emf</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(c)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Maximum current occurs</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(d)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Resonant frequency</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Current leads the emf</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below.</p>",
